OL,3,GNEWSANHS worker sent patient record
OL,4,Ascreenshot to partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital worker shared a screenshot
OL,7,Fof a patient's medical record with
OL,8,Ftheir partner after accessing up to 200
OL,9,Findividual patient records without
OL,10,Fpermission at a Somerset NHS trust, new
OL,11,Fdocuments reveal.
OL,13,FVictims told the BBC they are disgusted
OL,14,Fthe worker, who resigned before any
OL,15,Fdisciplinary action, received only a
OL,16,Fpolice caution.
