OL,3,GNEWSANHS worker sent patient record
OL,4,Ascreenshot to partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FCorrespondence obtained by the BBC
OL,7,Funder the Freedom of Information Act
OL,8,Fsuggests patient information may have
OL,9,Fbeen shared and that a patient was
OL,10,Fcontacted using a phone number obtained
OL,11,Ffrom hospital records.
OL,13,FSomerset NHS Foundation Trust
OL,14,Fpreviously said records belonging to up
OL,15,Fto 200 people were accessed
OL,16,Finappropriately between August 2017 and
OL,17,FOctober 2023.
